Converts a URL-encoded bookmarklet into readable JavaScript and adds it to the repository with updated documentation for emoji support.

## Changes

- **New bookmarklet**: `bookmarklets/wrap-code.js`
  - Wraps `<pre>` elements containing HTML/newlines with `<code>` tags
  - Wraps `pre.geist-overflow-scroll-y` elements with `<code>` tags  
